WEBVTT

00:00:02.250 --> 00:00:03.680
Oh, Banba-san?

00:00:03.680 --> 00:00:06.440
I figured out when the Kakyu 
Association deal's going down.

00:00:06.890 --> 00:00:09.270
<i>Okay, when is it?</i>

00:00:09.270 --> 00:00:10.650
Tonight at 10.

00:00:11.160 --> 00:00:13.560
Sit tight while I find out the location.

00:00:13.560 --> 00:00:14.660
<i>All right.</i>

00:00:14.660 --> 00:00:16.410
<i>Thanks, Enokida-kun.</i>

00:00:17.850 --> 00:00:19.660
You get it now?

00:00:19.660 --> 00:00:22.200
They trust me.

00:00:22.200 --> 00:00:26.890
If I tell them where the deal's 
going to take place, they <i>will</i> act.

00:00:26.890 --> 00:00:29.560
But if they don't hear anything from me,

00:00:29.560 --> 00:00:31.650
they might get cautious

00:00:31.650 --> 00:00:34.430
and go into hiding.

00:00:34.430 --> 00:00:36.340
So like I said...

00:00:37.430 --> 00:00:39.390
Man, you're so cold.

00:00:40.280 --> 00:00:42.640
I'm saying I'll help you guys out.

00:00:42.640 --> 00:00:44.930
So you're saying to let you live?

00:00:44.930 --> 00:00:45.930
Yeah, I guess.

00:00:46.470 --> 00:00:48.010
What's their plan?

00:00:49.960 --> 00:00:52.630
They're going to set up a deal with you guys,

00:00:52.630 --> 00:00:54.820
pretending to be human trafficking brokers.

00:00:55.340 --> 00:00:57.800
Lin Xianming will pose as the girl,

00:00:57.800 --> 00:01:00.530
get close to the mayor's son, 
and then kill him.

00:01:01.130 --> 00:01:03.500
That's their plan.

00:01:05.460 --> 00:01:10.390
I wonder if Lin-kun will 
like this turn of events.

00:01:11.880 --> 00:01:13.130
Why?

00:01:13.510 --> 00:01:17.090
You got sold out by the informant.

00:01:21.990 --> 00:01:25.980
What, are you so scared that you can't
talk to me without pointing guns at me?

00:01:25.980 --> 00:01:27.640
Playing tough, are we?

00:01:27.640 --> 00:01:30.500
You seem to think you still have friends.

00:01:30.500 --> 00:01:32.980
Thinking of that private eye, Banba?

00:01:34.010 --> 00:01:34.900
Yo.

00:01:42.630 --> 00:01:43.590
Banba?!

00:01:46.200 --> 00:01:49.290
This is the one who killed him.

00:01:49.290 --> 00:01:51.500
The Niwaka Samurai.

00:01:53.270 --> 00:01:55.050
The Niwaka Samurai!

00:03:28.290 --> 00:03:32.310
<b>#04  Ninth Inning, Two Outs</b>

00:03:35.510 --> 00:03:37.060
Just look at you.

00:03:37.060 --> 00:03:40.610
This is what happens when 
you underestimate grown-ups.

00:03:45.490 --> 00:03:47.070
What?!

00:03:47.070 --> 00:03:48.950
Banba's the Niwaka Samurai's target?

00:03:49.320 --> 00:03:51.580
What the hell's going on?!

00:03:51.580 --> 00:03:54.540
That was the client's request. 
What else could I do?

00:03:54.920 --> 00:03:57.550
But still... I mean, come on.

00:03:57.550 --> 00:04:00.210
Don't you think there's a 
slight problem with that?

00:04:00.210 --> 00:04:05.680
Well, things like this can happen when 
you've been in the business as long as I have.

00:04:05.680 --> 00:04:11.350
It might be the first time the 
Niwaka Samurai misses a mark.

00:04:19.140 --> 00:04:20.780
That's enough.

00:04:21.160 --> 00:04:23.770
Yo, lop his head off, too.

00:04:32.330 --> 00:04:35.500
<i>Banba... Damn you...</i>

00:04:35.500 --> 00:04:41.160
<i>How dare you die on me 
after saying you'd help me?</i>

00:04:43.050 --> 00:04:44.090
<i>Ear piercings?</i>

00:04:45.130 --> 00:04:47.000
<i>He didn't have any ear piercings...</i>

00:04:48.210 --> 00:04:49.510
Spicy pollock roe.

00:04:50.370 --> 00:04:51.890
A five-year supply, all right?

00:05:04.100 --> 00:05:04.880
Bastard!

00:05:26.440 --> 00:05:28.260
U-Unbelievable...

00:05:31.260 --> 00:05:32.970
M-Monster...

00:05:37.250 --> 00:05:38.420
You're...

00:05:41.110 --> 00:05:44.780
So what if you're the Niwaka 
Samurai or the hitmen hitman?!

00:05:45.140 --> 00:05:48.990
I'm gonna kill you myself!

00:05:49.700 --> 00:05:50.950
Don't, Shinohara!

00:06:01.780 --> 00:06:02.710
Seriously?

00:06:12.280 --> 00:06:16.990
<i>If I run now, I'll see him around 
every corner for the rest of my life.</i>

00:06:16.990 --> 00:06:18.060
<i>I don't want that anymore!</i>

00:06:26.040 --> 00:06:29.430
I doubt any of us will meet a good end.

00:06:36.580 --> 00:06:42.690
<b>Asakura Reiko 
Incoming Call</b>

00:06:45.960 --> 00:06:48.520
Who are you?

00:06:48.520 --> 00:06:49.680
Why help me?

00:06:49.680 --> 00:06:52.390
Oh, you haven't figured it out yet?

00:06:58.500 --> 00:07:00.060
Me. It's me.

00:07:01.350 --> 00:07:04.820
I figured it out, but I was just making sure!

00:07:05.300 --> 00:07:07.610
Then who the hell is that?!

00:07:09.900 --> 00:07:11.060
All right.

00:07:11.060 --> 00:07:12.950
Thanks, Enokida-kun.

00:07:13.560 --> 00:07:16.590
Jiro, can I buy this body from you?

00:07:16.590 --> 00:07:21.980
Sure, but we put out his 
eyes and cut off his head.

00:07:21.980 --> 00:07:23.580
That's even better.

00:07:23.580 --> 00:07:26.300
Oh, but can you do me a favor

00:07:26.300 --> 00:07:28.950
and give him a really awesome hairstyle?

00:07:29.540 --> 00:07:30.920
Kinda like this.

00:07:32.250 --> 00:07:34.550
Jiro used to be a hair stylist.

00:07:35.030 --> 00:07:39.910
I also had his face tweaked 
with Dr. Saeki's help.

00:07:39.910 --> 00:07:41.770
Okay, I get it.

00:07:42.550 --> 00:07:44.730
So was this the plan from the beginning?

00:07:45.110 --> 00:07:46.310
You tricked me.

00:07:46.310 --> 00:07:48.560
Don't be so mad.

00:07:48.560 --> 00:07:50.190
I did come to help, didn't I?

00:07:51.690 --> 00:07:53.160
Oh, old man?

00:07:53.160 --> 00:07:55.870
Oh, Banba. So you're okay.

00:07:55.870 --> 00:07:58.450
How was the Niwaka Samurai?

00:07:59.000 --> 00:08:01.460
<i>He wasn't as tough as the
rumors made him out to be.</i>

00:08:01.870 --> 00:08:06.420
Well, there are about ten other people 
who were killed instead of me, though.

00:08:06.420 --> 00:08:07.810
Got it.

00:08:07.810 --> 00:08:10.300
It's time for Mr. Clean to shine.

00:08:10.630 --> 00:08:14.490
Well, I suppose I'll go perform 
my civil servant duties now.

00:08:15.060 --> 00:08:16.800
Have fun!

00:08:17.110 --> 00:08:21.520
Well, let's go serve up some justice 
to that perverted asshole of a son.

00:08:25.010 --> 00:08:26.520
The mayor's son?

00:08:26.870 --> 00:08:29.280
He's the real killer?

00:08:29.280 --> 00:08:35.330
Yup. And the one who set you up is a 
female assassin in the mayor's employ.

00:08:35.330 --> 00:08:38.030
Wow... How'd you find all that out so quickly?

00:08:38.560 --> 00:08:43.080
Well, I guess what anyone 
needs is good friends.

00:08:44.680 --> 00:08:46.820
That guy I brought in 
earlier this afternoon...

00:08:46.820 --> 00:08:49.350
His little sister was killed.

00:08:49.350 --> 00:08:51.510
I see.

00:08:51.510 --> 00:08:57.450
Yeah. She was the Chinese student who 
was found dead in a hotel this morning.

00:08:57.450 --> 00:08:58.710
Hey, Banba-chan.

00:08:58.710 --> 00:09:00.310
Tell me more!

00:09:00.310 --> 00:09:01.500
Why?

00:09:01.500 --> 00:09:05.310
Someone I know got himself 
caught up in that mess.

00:09:05.310 --> 00:09:06.690
Really?

00:09:06.690 --> 00:09:09.520
What a small world.

00:09:10.600 --> 00:09:15.900
So that's why we'll be working together 
with the avenger from here on out.

00:09:16.310 --> 00:09:18.230
We hang out a lot.

00:09:18.230 --> 00:09:19.360
Don't worry.

00:09:19.360 --> 00:09:22.070
Who the hell are you, anyway?

00:09:22.070 --> 00:09:23.000
Hmm?

00:09:23.530 --> 00:09:25.910
Were you lying when you 
said you were a private eye?

00:09:25.910 --> 00:09:27.300
I am one.

00:09:27.300 --> 00:09:28.840
I'm a private eye <i>and</i> a hitman.

00:09:28.840 --> 00:09:30.920
A hitman of hitmen, huh?

00:09:30.920 --> 00:09:33.320
That's not exactly accurate.

00:09:33.320 --> 00:09:36.810
I just happened to accept 
a job to kill a hitman once.

00:09:36.810 --> 00:09:40.800
I got more jobs like that and ended 
up with that nickname, that's all.

00:09:41.160 --> 00:09:44.260
What's the whole Niwaka 
Samurai getup for, anyway?

00:09:44.260 --> 00:09:45.180
Is that a joke?

00:09:45.780 --> 00:09:48.150
A weird mask and a katana...

00:09:48.150 --> 00:09:51.230
Why would you stand out on purpose?

00:09:51.640 --> 00:09:55.900
For the same reason the 
redback spider has a red back.

00:09:55.900 --> 00:09:57.040
Huh?

00:09:57.040 --> 00:09:59.320
Because it's cooler that way.

00:10:00.970 --> 00:10:02.580
It's not cool at all.

00:10:02.580 --> 00:10:05.370
What? It's very cool.

00:10:13.730 --> 00:10:15.710
So this is where the mayor's son lives.

00:10:17.290 --> 00:10:19.210
How do we get inside?

00:10:20.550 --> 00:10:22.850
We just have to make him open the door.

00:10:25.060 --> 00:10:27.180
Hey, Reiko-san...

00:10:27.180 --> 00:10:29.920
When's my new girl gonna get here?

00:10:29.920 --> 00:10:31.820
Just wait a little longer!

00:10:31.820 --> 00:10:33.150
Okay.

00:10:34.330 --> 00:10:35.670
Did something happen?

00:10:37.190 --> 00:10:38.590
Hello?

00:10:38.590 --> 00:10:40.310
What's going on?

00:10:40.310 --> 00:10:41.570
<i>Asakura Reiko, correct?</i>

00:10:42.340 --> 00:10:43.670
Who are you?

00:10:43.670 --> 00:10:46.470
<i>Would you get the picture if I told 
you I was the Niwaka Samurai?</i>

00:10:47.620 --> 00:10:49.480
<i>I killed your colleagues.</i>

00:10:50.130 --> 00:10:52.500
<i>My target is the mayor's son.</i>

00:10:53.190 --> 00:10:55.340
<i>I'm coming to kill him.</i>

00:10:55.650 --> 00:10:57.030
I see.

00:10:57.030 --> 00:11:01.050
There are many condos in the 
mayor's name within city limits.

00:11:01.050 --> 00:11:02.480
Do you even know which one he's in?

00:11:02.480 --> 00:11:04.260
<i>The high-rise in Momochihama.</i>

00:11:05.940 --> 00:11:08.800
<i>Message from the informant:</i>

00:11:08.800 --> 00:11:13.230
<i>"There's something under your jacket collar."</i>

00:11:17.010 --> 00:11:18.320
That bastard!

00:11:21.060 --> 00:11:26.580
That's why it would've been wise
to be friendly with the informant.

00:11:28.580 --> 00:11:30.540
Reiko-san, are you going somewhere?

00:11:30.940 --> 00:11:32.180
I'm running away.

00:11:32.180 --> 00:11:35.750
A notorious hitman is coming to kill you.

00:11:35.750 --> 00:11:38.630
If I don't run now, I'll die along with you.

00:11:38.970 --> 00:11:39.960
What?

00:11:39.960 --> 00:11:42.150
Don't scare me like that!

00:11:42.730 --> 00:11:44.970
Wait, are you actually serious?

00:11:45.350 --> 00:11:47.330
Hey, take me with you.

00:11:47.330 --> 00:11:49.090
You wouldn't abandon me, would you?

00:11:49.730 --> 00:11:51.330
You make me sick.

00:11:51.330 --> 00:11:54.660
I'm not going to risk my life 
for a piece of shit like you!

00:12:01.030 --> 00:12:03.020
Hi. I'm an avenger.

00:12:03.020 --> 00:12:05.670
She's the one who took me 
back to the hotel in Nakasu!

00:12:06.950 --> 00:12:09.410
Guess that means no holding back.

00:12:12.490 --> 00:12:14.980
Oops, she's pretty heavy.

00:12:14.980 --> 00:12:17.210
Jiro, you guys stay here and keep watch.

00:12:17.610 --> 00:12:19.410
We'll check things out inside.

00:12:19.410 --> 00:12:20.930
Roger.

00:12:20.930 --> 00:12:22.420
Okay, let's go.

00:12:23.650 --> 00:12:24.690
Yeah.

00:12:40.570 --> 00:12:41.590
Damn it!

00:12:41.590 --> 00:12:42.660
Where is he?

00:12:42.660 --> 00:12:44.530
Come out, you perverted fuck!

00:12:45.330 --> 00:12:48.240
Patience is the key, Lin-chan.

00:13:02.050 --> 00:13:03.460
Idiot.

00:13:04.660 --> 00:13:07.930
Found you, shitbag.

00:13:13.270 --> 00:13:14.940
Just let me go!

00:13:15.940 --> 00:13:18.810
I'll let you live!

00:13:19.170 --> 00:13:21.050
Just shoot me.

00:13:21.050 --> 00:13:22.610
I don't care.

00:13:24.690 --> 00:13:27.190
You'll be killed anyway...

00:13:27.190 --> 00:13:32.240
by a guy they call the Niwaka Samurai,
who looks weird but has impressive skills.

00:13:32.840 --> 00:13:34.080
C'mon! Just shoot!

00:13:35.270 --> 00:13:36.780
What? Can't shoot?

00:13:36.780 --> 00:13:40.410
You can only kill women 
who are weaker than you?

00:13:40.850 --> 00:13:44.210
I bet that's the only way you can get 
it up, isn't it? You limp dick bastard!

00:13:46.530 --> 00:13:49.050
Sh-Shut up!

00:14:05.320 --> 00:14:06.820
I threw a pitch...

00:14:07.220 --> 00:14:08.730
Nice pitch.

00:14:08.730 --> 00:14:10.490
You have a good arm.

00:14:10.800 --> 00:14:11.240
Huh?

00:14:11.240 --> 00:14:14.320
He was a pitcher in high school.

00:14:14.320 --> 00:14:15.950
He even made it to Koshien.

00:14:16.370 --> 00:14:19.290
Oh, really?

00:14:36.650 --> 00:14:38.810
Say your name into the camera.

00:14:39.540 --> 00:14:42.070
H-Harada Yusuke.

00:14:42.700 --> 00:14:44.840
What's your father's name and profession?

00:14:45.990 --> 00:14:50.160
Mayor... Harada Shotaro...

00:14:50.740 --> 00:14:53.050
How many women have you killed?

00:14:53.050 --> 00:14:55.610
A-About five...

00:14:56.410 --> 00:14:57.650
I'm sorry...

00:14:58.930 --> 00:15:01.670
<i>Why were you never caught?</i>

00:15:02.180 --> 00:15:06.300
<i>Because Dad used his money to cover it all up...</i>

00:15:06.970 --> 00:15:12.680
<i>And Dad bought me a woman I could 
kill from human traffickers.</i>

00:15:13.880 --> 00:15:17.560
A young woman... maybe Chinese...

00:15:20.040 --> 00:15:21.160
Oops...

00:15:27.370 --> 00:15:28.470
Wh-What?!

00:15:28.470 --> 00:15:30.200
I'm telling the truth!

00:15:30.200 --> 00:15:32.200
Lin Qiaomei.

00:15:32.570 --> 00:15:33.660
Huh?

00:15:33.660 --> 00:15:36.620
The woman's name was Lin Qiaomei!

00:15:36.620 --> 00:15:39.790
My little sister!

00:15:49.780 --> 00:15:54.050
She was always smiling, even though 
we didn't have enough to eat every day.

00:15:54.400 --> 00:15:57.450
She only cried when we were apart.

00:15:57.880 --> 00:16:04.780
She'd been waiting for me... to come home!

00:16:04.780 --> 00:16:08.230
You'd never understand how Qiaomei felt!

00:16:08.810 --> 00:16:10.790
No one would!

00:16:10.790 --> 00:16:11.990
No one!

00:16:17.910 --> 00:16:21.910
S-Sorry...

00:16:32.950 --> 00:16:35.350
Jiro, it's your show now.

00:16:35.850 --> 00:16:37.290
You got it.

00:16:40.280 --> 00:16:42.260
Your turn, Maru-chan.

00:16:42.260 --> 00:16:43.170
Huh?

00:16:46.820 --> 00:16:48.630
I've been looking forward to this.

00:16:54.170 --> 00:16:59.870
Enokida-kun's supposed to stream 
that video online later.

00:17:00.790 --> 00:17:03.330
Mayor Harada will be ruined.

00:17:03.850 --> 00:17:06.600
His collusion with criminal 
organizations will also come to light.

00:17:07.250 --> 00:17:11.540
Detective Takeda, another casualty 
in all this, will finally rest in peace.

00:17:12.340 --> 00:17:19.130
But won't you and the avengers be targeted 
by the police if the son turns up dead?

00:17:19.800 --> 00:17:21.810
That won't be an issue.

00:17:22.290 --> 00:17:25.600
We made it so Asakura Reiko will 
take the fall for the death of Zhang

00:17:25.600 --> 00:17:28.780
of the Kakyu Association, as well 
as the abduction of the son.

00:17:28.780 --> 00:17:31.450
She framed an innocent man.

00:17:31.450 --> 00:17:34.280
Now, she'll suffer the same 
consequence as revenge.

00:17:35.170 --> 00:17:36.370
I see.

00:17:38.810 --> 00:17:41.100
I'll leave here as soon as tomorrow.

00:17:41.100 --> 00:17:45.230
Seeing his pathetic mug made 
me feel a little better,

00:17:45.230 --> 00:17:49.750
and I don't have any reason 
to stick around anymore.

00:17:50.290 --> 00:17:54.710
Well, not that there's any reason for me 
to be anywhere in the whole world.

00:17:55.730 --> 00:17:57.590
That won't do.

00:18:01.260 --> 00:18:03.090
It'd be a breach of contract.

00:18:03.560 --> 00:18:05.990
I need you to pay me my five-year 
supply of spicy pollock roe.

00:18:05.990 --> 00:18:06.730
Huh?

00:18:07.880 --> 00:18:08.790
See?

00:18:08.790 --> 00:18:11.900
That's a reason for you to stick around, no?

00:18:11.900 --> 00:18:14.610
I-Idiot!

00:18:15.140 --> 00:18:17.260
Who cares about spicy pollock roe?!

00:18:17.260 --> 00:18:19.010
Ow!

00:18:19.620 --> 00:18:22.360
Oops, I guess your wound reopened.

00:18:22.360 --> 00:18:23.120
Can you walk?

00:18:24.180 --> 00:18:25.530
I can't.

00:18:26.790 --> 00:18:28.310
Want a piggyback ride?

00:18:29.060 --> 00:18:30.070
Do it.

00:18:31.730 --> 00:18:32.870
Fine, fine.

00:18:36.890 --> 00:18:38.670
Aren't you hungry?

00:18:38.670 --> 00:18:41.300
I'll make you ramen when we get back.

00:18:41.300 --> 00:18:43.600
Tonkotsu ramen again?

00:18:43.920 --> 00:18:46.210
If you don't want it, I won't make it.

00:18:46.210 --> 00:18:47.750
I'll eat it.

00:18:47.750 --> 00:18:50.470
I never waste food.

00:18:59.700 --> 00:19:01.910
<b>Takeda 
Family Grave</b>

00:19:01.910 --> 00:19:05.870
<b>Hakata News 
Former Mayor Harada Arrested 
Links to Criminal Organizations</b>

00:19:10.890 --> 00:19:15.760
Okay, here's today's line-up.

00:19:15.760 --> 00:19:17.800
No. 1, Enokida, center field.

00:19:17.800 --> 00:19:19.430
All right.

00:19:19.430 --> 00:19:21.160
No. 2, Yamato, right field.

00:19:21.160 --> 00:19:22.140
'Kay!

00:19:22.140 --> 00:19:24.040
No. 3, Zen-chan, second base.

00:19:24.040 --> 00:19:24.550
Gotcha!

00:19:24.880 --> 00:19:26.820
No. 4, Maru-chan, first base.

00:19:26.820 --> 00:19:27.560
Yup.

00:19:27.560 --> 00:19:29.330
No. 5, Jiro-chan, left field.

00:19:29.330 --> 00:19:30.560
Hi.

00:19:30.560 --> 00:19:32.820
No. 6, Shige-chan, catcher.

00:19:32.820 --> 00:19:33.950
Right.

00:19:33.950 --> 00:19:36.280
No. 7, Dr. Saeki, third base.

00:19:36.280 --> 00:19:36.820
Okay.

00:19:36.820 --> 00:19:39.780
The next two are new to the team.

00:19:40.170 --> 00:19:41.590
No. 8, Lin, shortstop.

00:19:41.590 --> 00:19:43.630
He's totally new to the game.

00:19:43.630 --> 00:19:45.210
Hey, hang on a second!

00:19:45.210 --> 00:19:47.370
I never said I was gonna play baseball!

00:19:47.370 --> 00:19:50.260
Well, just give it a try this one time.

00:19:50.260 --> 00:19:52.330
It's pretty fun, Lin-Lin.

00:19:52.330 --> 00:19:55.460
Don't name me like a panda, moron Ban!

00:19:55.460 --> 00:19:58.090
What the hell is up with these 
lame-ass clothes, anyway?

00:19:58.090 --> 00:19:59.360
What?!

00:19:59.360 --> 00:20:00.800
They're super cool!

00:20:00.800 --> 00:20:03.450
I don't get your taste in clothes.

00:20:03.450 --> 00:20:05.200
Hey, Lin-Lin!

00:20:05.200 --> 00:20:07.280
Here's our second new member!

00:20:07.280 --> 00:20:09.250
No. 9, Saito, pitcher!

00:20:09.250 --> 00:20:12.910
Given his experience at Koshien,
 we have high hopes for him!

00:20:12.910 --> 00:20:14.730
Th-Thank you!

00:20:15.220 --> 00:20:16.230
Huh?

00:20:16.230 --> 00:20:18.440
Do you look different from before?

00:20:16.500 --> 00:20:18.440
<b>Before</b>

00:20:16.500 --> 00:20:18.440
<b>Now</b>

00:20:18.820 --> 00:20:22.310
Dr. Saeki gave me cosmetic surgery.

00:20:22.310 --> 00:20:26.050
Even though it was a setup, my face 
got released to the public as a killer's,

00:20:26.050 --> 00:20:27.910
so he thought I'd have a hard time otherwise.

00:20:27.910 --> 00:20:31.410
Yeah, your mug got plastered 
all over the net.

00:20:31.410 --> 00:20:33.850
Wait, you sold me out, didn't you?!

00:20:33.850 --> 00:20:34.670
You betrayed me!

00:20:34.670 --> 00:20:38.250
I sold information, but I didn't betray you.

00:20:38.250 --> 00:20:41.300
Like I can believe that, you 'shroom!

00:20:41.940 --> 00:20:43.460
What?!

00:20:43.460 --> 00:20:45.020
Hurry up and get ready.

00:20:45.020 --> 00:20:46.160
We're about to start.

00:20:46.160 --> 00:20:46.970
Huh?!

00:20:47.420 --> 00:20:52.790
We'll now begin the match between Dazaifu 
Sanders and the Hakata Tonkotsu Ramens.

00:20:52.790 --> 00:20:54.060
Both teams, bow!

00:20:54.060 --> 00:20:56.770
Thanks for playing us!

00:20:54.060 --> 00:20:56.770
<b>Dazaifu Sanders</b>

00:20:54.060 --> 00:20:56.770
<b>Hakata Tonkotsu Ramens</b>

00:21:06.850 --> 00:21:08.120
Nice pitch!

00:21:10.080 --> 00:21:12.040
Thank you!

00:21:12.820 --> 00:21:13.540
Hey!

00:21:13.920 --> 00:21:17.200
I don't know the rules of baseball!

00:21:17.200 --> 00:21:20.410
Catch the ball when the opponent 
hits it, and throw it to first base.

00:21:20.410 --> 00:21:22.760
Just start with that.

00:21:24.330 --> 00:21:28.090
So which one's first base?

00:21:28.500 --> 00:21:31.010
All right! Let's do this!

00:21:31.010 --> 00:21:32.930
Yeah!

00:22:30.820 --> 00:22:31.630
Banba-san!

00:22:31.630 --> 00:22:32.460
Help!

00:22:32.460 --> 00:22:33.700
Shadyjobs.com?

00:22:33.700 --> 00:22:34.780
I'm starving.

00:22:34.780 --> 00:22:36.410
That's mean.

00:22:36.410 --> 00:22:37.440
The Niwaka Samurai?

00:22:37.440 --> 00:22:39.210
We can't do away with the yamakasa, no.

00:22:39.210 --> 00:22:41.960
If you're going that far, let's do it!

00:23:05.610 --> 00:23:08.250
Don't! Please don't kill me!

00:23:11.610 --> 00:23:13.220
I'll give you one chance.

00:23:13.220 --> 00:23:16.490
If you can defeat me, I'll let you go.

00:23:32.810 --> 00:23:35.010
I only get boring jobs.

00:23:35.930 --> 00:23:40.940
#05 Tryouts
